  "factor_name": "Dispersion-gated market-residual short-horizon reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "lag1(-(rolling_prod(1+residual_return,5)-1) / rolling_std(residual_return,20) * clip(0.5 + percentile_rank(rolling_rank_cs_std(residual_return,20)),0.5,1.5))",
    "description": "For each of the 15 tradable benchmark instruments, subtracts equal-weight benchmark daily return, reverses the resulting five-session residual return, scales by 20-session residual volatility, and increases exposure when the cross-asset residual-return dispersion percentile is high. All inputs are lagged one session before ranking or portfolio use."
